      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashland%2C_Kentucky",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Paramount Arts Center, a historic theater, now hosts murals and bronze sculptures by Gines Serran-Pagán.",
